                                        "entry_id": "7e9c6de7-dee8-3d11-ab1b-6d39bc11d019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A reasonable amount and quality of goods or services for the amount of money one spends."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90f99806-6233-4aaa-a3cb-3f09fbc0a370",
                                                "sense_id": "4036ce31-993f-3917-8fbe-c58fb7d4bbb4",
                                                "text": "The new car was good value for money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da052eb6-005b-49cb-baab-cb8984312f4d",
                                                "sense_id": "4036ce31-993f-3917-8fbe-c58fb7d4bbb4",
                                                "text": "Her customers always get good value for money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31c330a5-0c40-4151-9fc1-6aa448dba506",
                                                "sense_id": "4036ce31-993f-3917-8fbe-c58fb7d4bbb4",
                                                "text": "'With a better value for money offer for our customers we may be able to look at what we do with fares going forward.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef95d5b-459c-487f-ba4e-424fec9d7ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "4036ce31-993f-3917-8fbe-c58fb7d4bbb4",
                                                "text": "How can an operator be, at the same time, top for overall satisfaction and bottom for value for money? I turned to Anthony Smith for the answer, leaning on his 20 years running Transport Focus and its predecessors.\nIt's commuters, he explained. \"You can't please commuters, you can only not displease them.\""
                                            }
